    Python script to extract emails and phone numbers from text.
    Uses Regular Expressions (Regex) for pattern matching.
    Supports multiple email formats (example@domain.com, .org, .co.in).
    Supports phone formats with country codes, brackets, dashes, or plain numbers.
    Lightweight — only uses Python’s built-in re module.
    Easy to customize for new patterns.
    Outputs results in a clean, formatted list.